{"id":57502,"date":"2026-08-07T10:36:52","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T09:36:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/gpa-do-pinhal-serta\/"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:15:36","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:15:36","slug":"gpa-do-pinhal-serta","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/gpa-do-pinhal-serta\/","title":{"rendered":"GPA do Pinhal \u2013 Sert\u00e3 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">GPA do Pinhal \u2013 Sert\u00e3 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>21\u00ba Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Atletismo do Pinhal 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>03 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como cen\u00e1rio a apraz\u00edvel <strong>Alameda da Carvalha<\/strong>, na vila da <strong>Sert\u00e3<\/strong>, distrito de Castelo Branco. Uma prova com mais de duas d\u00e9cadas de tradi\u00e7\u00e3o que celebra o atletismo e o conv\u00edvio desportivo no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da regi\u00e3o do Pinhal.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partidas e chegadas junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Justi\u00e7a, o programa acolhe a <strong>Corrida Principal de 9 km<\/strong> (seniores e veteranos), a <strong>Corrida de 5,5 km<\/strong> (juniores e veteranos seniores), a <strong>Marcha\/Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong> para todas as idades e diversas <strong>provas jovens dos 500m aos 2.250m<\/strong> (Benjamins a Juvenis).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Grupo Desportivo S\u00e3o Domingos e da C\u00e2mara Municipal da Sert\u00e3<\/strong>, com apoio da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Castelo Branco e Bombeiros da Sert\u00e3, oferecendo kit especial com medalh\u00e3o, queijo e chouri\u00e7o regional a todos os atletas que cruzem a meta, al\u00e9m de op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar de conv\u00edvio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; fon