ttom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o GPA do Pinhal \u2013 Sert\u00e3 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 03 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Alameda da Carvalha, junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Justi\u00e7a da Sert\u00e3.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o programa de partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas jovens come\u00e7am \u00e0s 15h20. A Corrida Principal de 9 km e a Corrida de 5,5 km partem \u00e0s 16h30, seguidas pela Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 16h32.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta nas provas de 9 km e 5,5 km?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas que terminem as corridas recebem saco, medalh\u00e3o comemorativo, queijo e chouri\u00e7o regional da terra, al\u00e9m de seguro e abastecimento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo da 21\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para download e visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o na ficha t\u00e9cnica da prova no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar de conv\u00edvio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o online os participantes podem optar pela inclus\u00e3o do jantar comemorativo (acr\u00e9scimo de 3\u20ac para atletas e 5\u20ac para acompanhantes).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"GPA do Pinhal \u2013 Sert\u00e3 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sert\u00e3, Castelo Branco\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sert\u00e3, Castelo Branco\", \"addressRegion\": \"Sert\u00e3, Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o GPA do Pinhal \u2013 Sert\u00e3 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 03 de Outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Alameda da Carvalha, junto ao Pal\u00e1cio da Justi\u00e7a da Sert\u00e3.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o programa de partidas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas jovens come\u00e7am \u00e0s 15h20. A Corrida Principal de 9 km e a Corrida de 5,5 km partem \u00e0s 16h30, seguidas pela Caminhada de 4 km \u00e0s 16h32.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de atleta nas provas de 9 km e 5,5 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os atletas que terminem as corridas recebem saco, medalh\u00e3o comemorativo, queijo e chouri\u00e7o regional da terra, al\u00e9m de seguro e abastecimento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial completo da 21\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para download e visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o na ficha t\u00e9cnica da prova no portal Portugal Running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar de conv\u00edvio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o online os participantes podem optar pela inclus\u00e3o do jantar comemorativo (acr\u00e9scimo de 3\u20ac para atletas e 5\u20ac para acompanhantes).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67884,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,478,624],"event_type_2":[535,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57502","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-serta-castelo-branco","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-castelo-branco","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-gpa-do-pinhal-serta-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57502","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=57502"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57502\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67971,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57502\/revisions\/67971"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/67884"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=57502"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=57502"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href